ixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nThis will enable FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE for all Android versions, including Android ROMs.\r\nFor Lineage `get_version()` reported the ROM version, not the SDK.\r\n\r\n[Godots minimum requirement](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/about/system_requirements.html) is Android 6.0, which is SDK 23.\r\nSAF should be [supported from SDK 19](https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/providers/document-provider) onward.\r\nAs suggested by @syntaxerror247 in #116335, the SDK check is removed completely.\r\n\r\nTested the project from the referenced bug report on my lineage 21 and on emulated android-24;default;x86_64 (SDK 24), native window opens with the patch applied on both.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Bugsquad Edit:_\r\n- Closes #116335\r\n- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115257","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":